<title>USA: Search Capital gets lenders' agreement.</title>
<headline>Search Capital gets lenders' agreement.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Search Capital Group Inc said on Friday that lenders to MS Financial Inc agreed to continue their financing arrangements with MS through the closing of its acquisition by Search.</p>
<p>The previously announced acquisition, still subject to regulatory approval, is expected to be completed by May 15. The agreement with the lenders allows MS Financial continued use of a $75 million line of credit to buy new loan contracts.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
